  "content": "\n\n<p>Требуется: Fabric, Origins, Pehkui</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Этот мод для Fabric добавляет 17 монстров из Monster Manual для D&amp;D 5e в Minecraft в качестве играбельных Origins. Они не предназначены для балансировки, а призваны оставаться верными оригинальной игре.</p>\n<p>Список Origins приведён ниже:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/975311/description_c8cb1129-dd69-49e7-ba43-2c48c2e217b4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"159\" height=\"308\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/975311/description_9a5b4bba-81b9-4480-a6c8-fa475530cffb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"159\" height=\"254\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/975311/description_4f5758fe-d770-477c-b0df-8db202120787.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"159\" height=\"344\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/975311/description_d4e13b48-7b50-45d4-9de9-337f1b2d427a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"159\" height=\"243\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/975311/description_e6be47d0-2413-4825-af0c-84192dcc42f7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"159\" height=\"182\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/975311/description_0b9c9f5d-ab4f-42d0-80c3-3e37260c7404.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"159\" height=\"286\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/975311/description_23b567ef-20b4-4ca5-96d9-2aa58f8293d7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"159\" height=\"330\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/975311/description_b480e5a9-4871-497e-9cfb-3a5b5889410f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"159\" height=\"247\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/975311/description_d8ff495d-569f-4e6a-9505-c970b398f7cd.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"159\" height=\"297\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/975311/description_022d872b-8a4c-4486-8a3d-f08562e58628.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"159\" height=\"272\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/975311/description_90e0a110-b323-456f-a478-01b9f060ba0c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"159\" height=\"453\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/975311/description_377b40d0-b97d-4e3e-af70-212249d40bdc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"159\" height=\"301\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/975311/description_4a956d4f-7bc2-44c7-92c6-69d903237705.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"159\" height=\"420\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/975311/description_4de2a8e1-cd3d-4413-a432-413fcb1fb383.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"159\" height=\"276\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/975311/description_185db185-ee15-47ca-be06-1c9eb0b79dfa.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"159\" height=\"265\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/975311/description_c1f5ea7d-8f7d-4162-b8f6-3a9513b47156.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"159\" height=\"294\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/975311/description_d60040ff-3002-43d1-a9d9-adff62f03726.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"159\" height=\"362\"></p>",
